---
// Figure for the stocks-basics series, Post 8 (macro and industry). Numbers are from the sources cited in the post.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 286;
---
<figure class="sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline">
  <div class="sc">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="SBV refinancing rate: 4.0% until 22 September 2022, 5.0% from 23 September, 6.0% from 25 October, then cut to 5.5% in March 2023, 5.0% on 25 May and 4.5% on 19 June. VN-Index peak 1,536 on 10 January 2022 and low 873.78 on 16 November 2022.">
      <text x="20" y="28" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>The refinancing rate (red) against two dates on the VN-Index (2022-2023)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lãi suất tái cấp vốn (đỏ) và hai mốc của VN-Index (2022-2023)</tspan></text>
<line x1="60" y1="230.0" x2="860" y2="230.0" class="grid" />
      <text x="54" y="234.0" class="m" text-anchor="end">4.0%</text>
      <line x1="60" y1="170.0" x2="860" y2="170.0" class="grid" />
      <text x="54" y="174.0" class="m" text-anchor="end">5.0%</text>
      <line x1="60" y1="110.0" x2="860" y2="110.0" class="grid" />
      <text x="54" y="114.0" class="m" text-anchor="end">6.0%</text>
      <line x1="70.0" y1="236" x2="70.0" y2="244" class="ln" />
      <text x="70.0" y="260" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Jan 2022</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>T1/2022</tspan></text>
      <line x1="319.0" y1="236" x2="319.0" y2="244" class="ln" />
      <text x="319.0" y="260" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Jul 2022</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>T7/2022</tspan></text>
      <line x1="568.0" y1="236" x2="568.0" y2="244" class="ln" />
      <text x="568.0" y="260" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Jan 2023</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>T1/2023</tspan></text>
      <line x1="817.0" y1="236" x2="817.0" y2="244" class="ln" />
      <text x="817.0" y="260" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Jul 2023</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>T7/2023</tspan></text>
      <line x1="60" y1="236" x2="860" y2="236" class="ln" />
      <polyline points="70.0,230.0 433.1,230.0 433.1,170.0 476.7,170.0 476.7,110.0 669.7,110.0 669.7,140.0 767.2,140.0 767.2,170.0 800.4,170.0 800.4,200.0 841.9,200.0" class="lnr" />
      <line x1="82.5" y1="60" x2="82.5" y2="230.0" class="grid" />
      <text x="78.5" y="56" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>10 Jan: VN-Index peak 1,536</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>10/1: VN-Index đỉnh 1.536</tspan></text>
      <line x1="505.8" y1="84" x2="505.8" y2="236" class="grid" />
      <text x="511.8" y="92" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>16 Nov: low 873.78</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>16/11: đáy 873,78</tspan></text>
      <text x="425.1" y="204.0" class="b" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>23 Sep: refi 4.0 → 5.0</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>23/9: tái cấp vốn 4,0 → 5,0</tspan></text>
      <text x="468.7" y="162.0" class="b" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>25 Oct: 5.0 → 6.0</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>25/10: 5,0 → 6,0</tspan></text>
      <text x="677.7" y="102.0" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Mar: 5.5</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>T3: 5,5</tspan></text>
      <text x="775.2" y="132.0" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>25 May: 5.0</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>25/5: 5,0</tspan></text>
      <text x="790.4" y="222.0" class="b" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>19 Jun: 4.5</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>19/6: 4,5</tspan></text>
      <text x="70" y="222.0" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>4.0% since Oct 2020</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>4,0% từ 10/2020</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The index peaked about eight months before the first hike and bottomed three weeks after the second. Prices move on what people expect the rate to do, so the decision date is a late signal. Sources: SBV Decisions 1606 and 1809, The Investor, VinaCapital.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Chỉ số đạt đỉnh khoảng tám tháng trước lần tăng đầu và chạm đáy ba tuần sau lần tăng thứ hai. Giá chạy theo kỳ vọng về lãi suất, nên ngày ra quyết định là tín hiệu muộn. Nguồn: Quyết định 1606 và 1809 của NHNN, The Investor, VinaCapital.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sc { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline .t { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline .h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline .b { font-size: 12.8px; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline .n { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline .red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline .grn { fill: var(--act-2); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline .gld { fill: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline .cardr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline .cardg { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline .cardk { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.4; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline .lng { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2.4; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline .barr { fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline .barg { fill: var(--act-2); }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline .barm { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline .bard { fill: var(--gold); }
  .sbp8-sbp08ratetimeline figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
